This directory is the upstream source for the BackupRestore reusable module.

When syncing to a project, use:

    rsync -av --delete /home/gabor/development/Reusables/BackupRestore/ lib/BackupRestore/

Run a diff before every sync to detect unexpected local drift in the project copy:

    diff -r /home/gabor/development/Reusables/BackupRestore/ lib/BackupRestore/

DO NOT edit files in the project's lib/BackupRestore/ directory directly.
All changes must be made here (upstream) first, then synced.
